      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Topical anti-inflammatory management of superficial and deep phlebopathy with feprazone and benzidamine was compared in a double-blind test. Both drugs were active and well tolerated. Significantly less time was needed to obtain a cure with feprazone."},
